Package: climateBR
Type: Package
Title: Download Weather, Natural Disaster, and Fire Hotspot Data from Brazil
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Kaio", 
      "Bárbara", 
      email = "kaio.rbarbara@ufpe.br", 
      role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
      comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0003-4884-7980")
    )
  )
Description: Provides functions to download and import meteorological
     data from Brazil's National Institute of Meteorology (INMET)
     <https://portal.inmet.gov.br>, historical rainfall records from
     Pernambuco's Water and Climate Agency (APAC)
     <https://www.apac.pe.gov.br>, natural disaster records from the
     Brazilian Atlas of Natural Disasters maintained by the Ministry of
     Integration and Regional Development (MIDR)
     <https://atlasdigital.mdr.gov.br>, and satellite-detected fire
     hotspots from the National Institute for Space Research (INPE)
     <https://data.inpe.br/queimadas/>.
